    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "The earlier chat-formatting entry establishes the introduction of these default_chat_prompt overrides; the MiMo entry establishes its thin Llama-derived adapter and deliberate omission of MTP support. Neither supplies fresh runtime validation of this import repair.",
