        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Issue #7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d concerns native-extension loading; issue #17, \u201cModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'torch' when installing requirements.txt,\u201d concerns installation; PR #4, \u201cchore: update config.py,\u201d proposes a spelling correction. Their relevance is inferred only from overlapping inspected paths or dependency terms, not an upstream association with this fix.",
